# Syncthing Device ID Registry
#
# This file maps hostnames to their syncthing device IDs.
# Device IDs are public and safe to commit to version control.
#
# To get a device ID from an existing system:
#   syncthing -device-id
#
# Or from the syncthing web UI under Actions > Show ID
#
# To generate new credentials and get the device ID:
#   nix run .#syncthing-keygen -- <hostname>
